              options: ["The performance of a civic obligation for the common good","A desire for special rewards","A violation of personal freedom","An unnecessary action because cleanliness is the janitor’s duty only"], answer: 0 },
            { chapter: "Grade 9 – Chapter 2: Rights and Obligations of Citizens",
