              options: ["Fulfilling citizens’ right to education","Ignoring the principle of self-reliance","Giving unfair advantages to certain groups","Reducing citizens’ obligations"], answer: 0 },
            { chapter: "Grade 9 – Chapter 2: Rights and Obligations of Citizens",
